# VRM animation playback (Mixamo + Kimodo + studio bar)

**Protected baseline:** `memory-bank/vrm-animation-protected-state.md` + `.cursor/rules/vrm-animation-protected.mdc` (user-confirmed 2026-06-27).

## Non-negotiable invariant

When `vrm.humanoid.autoUpdateHumanBones === true` (required for skinning):

1. **AnimationMixer tracks MUST target normalized humanoid bones** (`resolveVrmBoneTrackName`), not raw skeleton bones.
2. Each frame after `mixer.update(delta)`: call `humanoid.update()` then `vrm.update(delta)` (`applyVrmHumanoidPose`).
3. Mixer root is `vrm.scene`; loot FBX URLs must stay canonical (`2_Idle.fbx`, not `Idle.fbx`).

Violating (1) causes **silent failure**: mixer time advances, logs show loaded clips, avatar stays frozen.

## Primary VRM + single mixer (Jun 2026 lock)

- `primaryAnimationVrm` → active controls = VRM only; `_silenceOrphanFbxMixer()` on preset/Kimodo load.
- Standard VRM0 retarget axis fix on all bones; full shoulder+arm tracks; `withNeutralVrmSceneRootForRetarget` for bind sampling only.

## Before merging animation changes

```bash
npm run test:run -- src/__tests__/loadMixamoAnimation.test.js src/__tests__/animationManager.playback.test.js src/__tests__/kimodoMotionLoader.test.js src/__tests__/vrmMixamoPlaybackGuard.test.js
npm run test:anim-smoke   # optional; needs https://<Surface-LAN-IP>:3000/?animSmoke=1
```

## Do not revert without replacement

- `resolveVrmBoneTrackName` — normalized before raw
- `_getActiveAnimationControls` / `_silenceOrphanFbxMixer` — prevents layered limbs
- `setAnimationFrameHook` in sceneManager render/XR loops
- `syncAnimationPrimaryTarget` on VRM load
- Studio bar uses `LOOT_DEFAULT_ANIMATIONS` only (`_studioDefaultsLoaded` blocks trait manifest overwrite)
- `normalizeLootAssetUrl` must not collapse `https://`
- Kimodo: `applyStudioMotionToAnimationManager` + `buildVrmAnimationClipFromStudioMotion` — same retarget rules as Mixamo
